    <item>
      <title>Application received</title>
      <link>https://howardhliu.com/apply/thanks/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://howardhliu.com/apply/thanks/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;apply-thanks&#34;&gt;
&lt;p class=&#34;apply-thanks-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-check-circle&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you — your application to the Liu Research Lab has been submitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What happens next&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will hear from Prof. Liu by email after the deadline, typically within two weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promising applicants are invited to a short conversation (15–20 minutes) to talk about your interests and possible projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admitted members enroll in two credits of POLI 498 and join the Tuesday 12:00–1:00 p.m. lab meeting the following semester.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions in the meantime, or need to correct something in your application, email

&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:howard.hl.liu@gmail.com&#34;&gt;howard.hl.liu@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt; with &amp;ldquo;Lab application&amp;rdquo; in the subject line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/&#34;&gt;← Back to the lab homepage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Apply to the Liu Research Lab</title>
      <link>https://howardhliu.com/apply/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://howardhliu.com/apply/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;apply-intro&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in joining the lab. Before you begin, please read the

&lt;a href=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/application/application-undergrad/&#34;&gt;key information for prospective members&lt;/a&gt; and the

&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/lvlgxtnoffurd2fpbl3tg/Applicant-manual.pdf?rlkey=b777jxfm4ciadocgkv6xnogge&amp;amp;dl=0&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Applicant Manual&lt;/a&gt;,
which explain what we do, what we expect, and how applications are evaluated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The form takes about 30–45 minutes. Your text answers are saved in your browser as you type, so you
can leave and come back on the same device. You will need a &lt;strong&gt;PDF of your résumé/CV&lt;/strong&gt;; an unofficial
transcript and a writing sample are optional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; applications for Spring 2027 are due &lt;strong&gt;November 15, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;. We review applications on a
rolling basis after the deadline and will respond by email within two weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;form
  name=&#34;liu-lab-application&#34;
  method=&#34;POST&#34;
  action=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/apply/thanks/&#34;
  enctype=&#34;multipart/form-data&#34;
  data-netlify=&#34;true&#34;
  netlify-honeypot=&#34;bot-field&#34;
  class=&#34;apply-form&#34;
  id=&#34;apply-form&#34;
  novalidate
&gt;
  &lt;input type=&#34;hidden&#34; name=&#34;form-name&#34; value=&#34;liu-lab-application&#34;&gt;
  &lt;p class=&#34;d-none&#34;&gt;
    &lt;label&gt;Don&#39;t fill this out if you&#39;re human: &lt;input name=&#34;bot-field&#34;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;/p&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;apply-step&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; About you&lt;/legend&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-row&#34;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;full_name&#34;&gt;Full name &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;full_name&#34; name=&#34;full_name&#34; autocomplete=&#34;name&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;preferred_name&#34;&gt;Preferred name / pronouns &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;preferred_name&#34; name=&#34;preferred_name&#34;&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-row&#34;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;email&#34;&gt;USC email &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; placeholder=&#34;you@email.sc.edu&#34; autocomplete=&#34;email&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;phone&#34;&gt;Phone &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;tel&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;phone&#34; name=&#34;phone&#34; autocomplete=&#34;tel&#34;&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-row&#34;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;major&#34;&gt;Major(s) &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;major&#34; name=&#34;major&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. Political Science&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-6&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;minor&#34;&gt;Minor(s) / concentration &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;minor&#34; name=&#34;minor&#34;&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-row&#34;&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-4&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;class_standing&#34;&gt;Class standing &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;select class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;class_standing&#34; name=&#34;class_standing&#34; required&gt;
          &lt;option value=&#34;&#34; selected disabled&gt;Select…&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;option&gt;First-year&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;option&gt;Sophomore&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;option&gt;Junior&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;option&gt;Senior&lt;/option&gt;
        &lt;/select&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-4&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;graduation&#34;&gt;Expected graduation &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;graduation&#34; name=&#34;graduation&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. May 2028&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-group col-md-4&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label for=&#34;gpa&#34;&gt;Current GPA &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;number&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;gpa&#34; name=&#34;gpa&#34; min=&#34;0&#34; max=&#34;4&#34; step=&#34;0.01&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. 3.65&#34; required&gt;
        &lt;small class=&#34;form-text text-muted&#34;&gt;No minimum, but see the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/lvlgxtnoffurd2fpbl3tg/Applicant-manual.pdf?rlkey=b777jxfm4ciadocgkv6xnogge&amp;dl=0&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Applicant Manual&lt;/a&gt; on GPA.&lt;/small&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;semester&#34;&gt;Semester you are applying to join &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;select class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;semester&#34; name=&#34;semester&#34; required&gt;
        &lt;option value=&#34;&#34; selected disabled&gt;Select…&lt;/option&gt;
        &lt;option&gt;Spring 2027&lt;/option&gt;
        &lt;option&gt;Fall 2027&lt;/option&gt;
        &lt;option&gt;Spring 2028&lt;/option&gt;
      &lt;/select&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;referral&#34;&gt;How did you hear about the lab? &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;referral&#34; name=&#34;referral&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. POLI class, a current member, Office of Undergraduate Research&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;apply-step&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Background &amp;amp; skills&lt;/legend&gt;
    &lt;p class=&#34;apply-help&#34;&gt;None of these are prerequisites. They help us match you to a project and a mentor.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;coursework&#34;&gt;Relevant coursework &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(statistics, research methods, data science, area studies, etc.)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;textarea class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;coursework&#34; name=&#34;coursework&#34; rows=&#34;3&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. POLI 301, STAT 201, CSCE 145 (in progress)&#34;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;d-block&#34;&gt;Programming experience&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;form-row&#34;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&#34;col-md-6 form-group mb-2&#34;&gt;
          &lt;label for=&#34;skill_r&#34; class=&#34;small mb-1&#34;&gt;R&lt;/label&gt;
          &lt;select class=&#34;form-control form-control-sm&#34; id=&#34;skill_r&#34; name=&#34;skill_r&#34;&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;None&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Beginner (a class or tutorial)&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Intermediate (own analyses, tidyverse)&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Advanced (packages, pipelines, modeling)&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;/select&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class=&#34;col-md-6 form-group mb-2&#34;&gt;
          &lt;label for=&#34;skill_python&#34; class=&#34;small mb-1&#34;&gt;Python&lt;/label&gt;
          &lt;select class=&#34;form-control form-control-sm&#34; id=&#34;skill_python&#34; name=&#34;skill_python&#34;&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;None&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Beginner (a class or tutorial)&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Intermediate (pandas, scripting)&lt;/option&gt;
            &lt;option&gt;Advanced (ML / LLM / scraping projects)&lt;/option&gt;
          &lt;/select&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;skill_other&#34; name=&#34;skill_other&#34; placeholder=&#34;Other tools: Stata, SQL, GIS, Git, Excel, AI tools (Claude/Codex)…&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;languages&#34;&gt;Language skills &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(especially Mandarin Chinese; note reading/speaking level)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;languages&#34; name=&#34;languages&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. Mandarin (heritage speaker, reads simplified), Spanish (intermediate)&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;region_experience&#34;&gt;Experience living in, studying, or following a relevant region &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;region_experience&#34; name=&#34;region_experience&#34; placeholder=&#34;e.g. study abroad in Taipei; family from Hong Kong; coursework on Latin America&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;d-block&#34;&gt;Which of these sounds most like you? &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(pick any; see the “Skill Sets” section of the manual)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox&#34;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;type_analyst&#34; name=&#34;profile[]&#34; value=&#34;Analyst&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;type_analyst&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; — I want to master research design and data analysis to run my own studies.&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox&#34;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;type_fixer&#34; name=&#34;profile[]&#34; value=&#34;Fixer&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;type_fixer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Fixer&lt;/strong&gt; — I&#39;m organized and reliable; I like keeping projects and people on track.&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox&#34;&gt;
        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;type_comp&#34; name=&#34;profile[]&#34; value=&#34;Computational Researcher&#34;&gt;
        &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;type_comp&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Computational Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; — I have (or want) data-science and programming skills to build datasets and pipelines.&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;apply-step&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; Commitment&lt;/legend&gt;
    &lt;p class=&#34;apply-help&#34;&gt;Please confirm you have read the &lt;a href=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/application/application-undergrad/&#34;&gt;time commitment&lt;/a&gt; and can meet it.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-2&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;c_meeting&#34; name=&#34;confirm_meeting&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;c_meeting&#34;&gt;I can attend the weekly lab meeting on &lt;strong&gt;Tuesdays, 12:00–1:00 p.m.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-2&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;c_hours&#34; name=&#34;confirm_hours&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;c_hours&#34;&gt;I can commit &lt;strong&gt;5–10 hours per week&lt;/strong&gt; to lab work in addition to meetings. &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-2&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;c_credits&#34; name=&#34;confirm_poli498&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;c_credits&#34;&gt;I will enroll in &lt;strong&gt;two credits of POLI 498 (Research Experience)&lt;/strong&gt; if admitted. &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-2&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;c_multiyear&#34; name=&#34;confirm_multiyear&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;c_multiyear&#34;&gt;I am interested in staying in the lab for more than one semester.&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-3&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;c_funding&#34; name=&#34;interest_funding&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;c_funding&#34;&gt;I would like help applying for &lt;a href=&#34;https://sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/undergraduate_research/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Undergraduate Research Funds&lt;/a&gt; (e.g. Magellan).&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;other_commitments&#34;&gt;Other major commitments this semester &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(jobs, athletics, leadership roles — optional)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;other_commitments&#34; name=&#34;other_commitments&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;apply-step&#34;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; Short-answer questions&lt;/legend&gt;
    &lt;p class=&#34;apply-help&#34;&gt;
      Aim for roughly &lt;strong&gt;150–300 words&lt;/strong&gt; per answer. Your answers are evaluated for content
      &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; as a signal of how clearly you think and write, so proofread before you submit.
      Your draft is saved in this browser automatically.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group apply-essay&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;q1&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;q-num&#34;&gt;Q1.&lt;/span&gt; Why are you interested in becoming a part of the Liu Lab? What do you hope to gain from the experience? &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;textarea class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;q1&#34; name=&#34;q1&#34; rows=&#34;8&#34; required data-words&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;word-count text-muted small&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group apply-essay&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;q2&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;q-num&#34;&gt;Q2.&lt;/span&gt; After looking at the &lt;a href=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/#projects&#34;&gt;lab website&lt;/a&gt;, which research project is most interesting to you and why? &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;textarea class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;q2&#34; name=&#34;q2&#34; rows=&#34;8&#34; required data-words&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;word-count text-muted small&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group apply-essay&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;q3&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;q-num&#34;&gt;Q3.&lt;/span&gt; Tell me a bit about what makes you tick, as it relates to the study of authoritarian politics, repression, or political conflict. &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;small class=&#34;form-text text-muted mb-2&#34;&gt;This can be an observation or question from following politics at home or abroad, a reading or unit in a class you found especially interesting, or the motivation for what you want to do after graduation. A fully formed research question is not expected — we want to know what interests you.&lt;/small&gt;
      &lt;textarea class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;q3&#34; name=&#34;q3&#34; rows=&#34;8&#34; required data-words&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;word-count text-muted small&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group apply-essay&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;q4&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;q-num&#34;&gt;Q4.&lt;/span&gt; What skills or experiences do you have that would make you a valuable part of the lab? &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;small class=&#34;form-text text-muted mb-2&#34;&gt;Coursework in statistics or research methods, programming (R, Python, other), language skills (especially Mandarin Chinese), experience living in or studying a relevant region, and experience organizing people or projects.&lt;/small&gt;
      &lt;textarea class=&#34;form-control&#34; id=&#34;q4&#34; name=&#34;q4&#34; rows=&#34;8&#34; required data-words&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
      &lt;div class=&#34;word-count text-muted small&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;legend&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;apply-step&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; Documents&lt;/legend&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;cv&#34;&gt;Résumé / CV &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(PDF, max 5 MB)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;file&#34; class=&#34;form-control-file&#34; id=&#34;cv&#34; name=&#34;cv&#34; accept=&#34;.pdf&#34; required&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;transcript&#34;&gt;Unofficial transcript &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(PDF, optional — Self Service Carolina export is fine)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;file&#34; class=&#34;form-control-file&#34; id=&#34;transcript&#34; name=&#34;transcript&#34; accept=&#34;.pdf&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
      &lt;label for=&#34;writing_sample&#34;&gt;Writing sample &lt;small class=&#34;text-muted&#34;&gt;(PDF, optional — a course paper you are proud of)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;file&#34; class=&#34;form-control-file&#34; id=&#34;writing_sample&#34; name=&#34;writing_sample&#34; accept=&#34;.pdf&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;

  
  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;apply-section&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;custom-control custom-checkbox mb-3&#34;&gt;
      &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; class=&#34;custom-control-input&#34; id=&#34;attest&#34; name=&#34;attest&#34; value=&#34;yes&#34; required&gt;
      &lt;label class=&#34;custom-control-label&#34; for=&#34;attest&#34;&gt;I confirm that the information above is accurate and that the short answers are my own writing. &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;apply-error alert alert-danger d-none&#34; role=&#34;alert&#34;&gt;
      Please complete all required fields (marked &lt;span class=&#34;req&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;) before submitting.
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-primary btn-lg apply-submit&#34;&gt;Submit application &lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-paper-plane ml-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button type=&#34;button&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-link apply-clear&#34;&gt;Clear saved draft&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;

&lt;script&gt;
(function () {
  var form = document.getElementById(&#39;apply-form&#39;);
  if (!form) return;
  var KEY = &#39;liu-lab-application-draft&#39;;

   
  function countWords(s) { s = s.trim(); return s ? s.split(/\s+/).length : 0; }
  form.querySelectorAll(&#39;textarea[data-words]&#39;).forEach(function (ta) {
    var out = ta.parentNode.querySelector(&#39;.word-count&#39;);
    function update() { out.textContent = countWords(ta.value) + &#39; words&#39;; }
    ta.addEventListener(&#39;input&#39;, update); update();
  });

   
  var fields = form.querySelectorAll(&#39;input:not([type=file]):not([type=hidden]):not([name=bot-field]), select, textarea&#39;);
  function save() {
    var data = {};
    fields.forEach(function (f) {
      if (f.type === &#39;checkbox&#39;) data[f.id] = f.checked; else data[f.id] = f.value;
    });
    try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(data)); } catch (e) {}
  }
  function restore() {
    var raw; try { raw = localStorage.getItem(KEY); } catch (e) { return; }
    if (!raw) return;
    var data = JSON.parse(raw);
    fields.forEach(function (f) {
      if (!(f.id in data)) return;
      if (f.type === &#39;checkbox&#39;) f.checked = !!data[f.id]; else f.value = data[f.id];
      f.dispatchEvent(new Event(&#39;input&#39;));
    });
  }
  restore();
  fields.forEach(function (f) { f.addEventListener(&#39;input&#39;, save); f.addEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, save); });

  form.querySelector(&#39;.apply-clear&#39;).addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, function () {
    if (!confirm(&#39;Clear your saved draft and reset the form?&#39;)) return;
    try { localStorage.removeItem(KEY); } catch (e) {}
    form.reset();
    form.querySelectorAll(&#39;textarea[data-words]&#39;).forEach(function (ta) { ta.dispatchEvent(new Event(&#39;input&#39;)); });
  });

   
  form.addEventListener(&#39;submit&#39;, function (e) {
    var err = form.querySelector(&#39;.apply-error&#39;);
    if (!form.checkValidity()) {
      e.preventDefault();
      form.classList.add(&#39;was-validated&#39;);
      err.classList.remove(&#39;d-none&#39;);
      var first = form.querySelector(&#39;:invalid&#39;);
      if (first) first.scrollIntoView({ behavior: &#39;smooth&#39;, block: &#39;center&#39; });
      return;
    }
    var cv = form.querySelector(&#39;#cv&#39;);
    if (cv.files[0] &amp;&amp; cv.files[0].size &gt; 5 * 1024 * 1024) {
      e.preventDefault();
      err.textContent = &#39;Your CV is larger than 5 MB. Please compress it and try again.&#39;;
      err.classList.remove(&#39;d-none&#39;);
      return;
    }
    err.classList.add(&#39;d-none&#39;);
    try { localStorage.removeItem(KEY); } catch (e2) {}
    form.querySelector(&#39;.apply-submit&#39;).disabled = true;
  });
})();
&lt;/script&gt;

</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Apply to Join Us</title>
      <link>https://howardhliu.com/application/application-undergrad/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://howardhliu.com/application/application-undergrad/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-work-does-this-lab-do&#34;&gt;What work does this Lab do?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Liu Research Lab is a collaborative research group in the Department of Political Science at the University of South Carolina, directed by Prof. Howard Liu and driven by the curiosity of the students involved. We study the causes and consequences of state violence and human rights abuses: why governments repress, how repression travels across borders to target diasporas and dissidents abroad, how ordinary people respond to it through protest and resistance, and what happens in the aftermath.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our research is empirical and computational. Depending on the project, lab members help build original datasets from news reports, archives, and government documents; code and map political events; run surveys and survey experiments; and analyze the results using spatial and network analysis, causal inference, and text-as-data methods in R. Students contribute to ongoing, grant-funded projects while at times developing their own research questions that connect to the lab&amp;rsquo;s agenda.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;why-join-the-lab&#34;&gt;Why join the Lab?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal of this Lab experience is to enable students to develop the analytical, methodological and writing skills necessary to 1) successfully execute a high-quality independent research project before they graduate and 2) plan for and attain post-graduation opportunities (job, graduate school, fellowship, etc.) that utilize those skills. Equally important are the opportunities to 1) work closely with a faculty member outside of the classroom environment and 2) interact with other students interested in data analysis and research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-is-the-time-commitment&#34;&gt;What is the time commitment?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New lab members can sign up for two credits of &lt;strong&gt;POLI 498 (Research Experience)&lt;/strong&gt; and have a high likelihood of receiving 
&lt;a href=&#34;https://sc.edu/about/offices_and_divisions/undergraduate_research/funding_opportunities/our_funding/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Undergraduate Research Funds&lt;/a&gt; if they apply in time. Members will meet every &lt;strong&gt;Tuesday from 12:00–1:00 p.m.&lt;/strong&gt; for the weekly lab meeting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to lab meetings, joining the lab is a &lt;strong&gt;5–10 hour/week commitment&lt;/strong&gt; working on collaborative or independent research projects. At the end of each semester, lab members put together a presentation highlighting what they have accomplished individually and with their teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-makes-for-a-successful-applicant&#34;&gt;What makes for a successful applicant?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applicants from any major and any year. No prior research or coding experience is required; what matters most is curiosity about the questions we study, reliability, and a willingness to learn. That said, the students who thrive in the lab tend to share a few traits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine interest&lt;/strong&gt; in state repression, human rights, protest, or authoritarian politics, ideally with some idea of the questions you would like to pursue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/strong&gt; Much of our work involves carefully reading research articles, programming, and designing experiments, where small mistakes matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with (or eagerness to learn) data analytics in R.&lt;/strong&gt; Coursework in statistics, research methods, or data science is a plus, but we will train members from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Show up to Tuesday meetings, do the work, meet deadlines, and communicate early when something is getting in the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before applying, please read the 
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/lvlgxtnoffurd2fpbl3tg/Applicant-manual.pdf?rlkey=b777jxfm4ciadocgkv6xnogge&amp;amp;dl=0&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Applicant Manual&lt;/a&gt;, which describes the application process, what to include in your materials, and what to expect in your first semester. Questions can be sent to 
&lt;a href=&#34;mailto:howard.liu@sc.edu&#34;&gt;howard.liu@sc.edu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;application&#34;&gt;Application&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Spring 2027 application to the lab will be posted 
&lt;a href=&#34;&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; during the Fall 2026 semester. The application, interview, and decisionmaking timeline will be posted here when it is available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;ready-to-apply&#34;&gt;Ready to apply?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications are submitted through our online portal. Have a PDF of your résumé/CV ready; an unofficial transcript and a writing sample are optional. The form takes about 30–45 minutes, and your answers are saved in your browser as you type.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&#34;apply-portal-cta&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary btn-lg&#34; href=&#34;https://howardhliu.com/apply/&#34;&gt;Open the application portal &lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-arrow-right ml-1&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deadline for Spring 2027: November 15, 2026.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
